The main issues that were causing strange characters:

1. Template literal backticks with embedded expressions were causing encoding issues when generating the PDF
2. Non-ASCII characters in the data (like smart quotes, em dashes, etc.) weren't being properly sanitized
3. The addWrappedText function needed to clean the text before processing

The fix:

· Replaced all template literals ( `text ${variable}` ) with string concatenation ('text ' + variable)
· Added text cleaning with .replace(/[^\x20-\x7E]/g, '') to remove any non-ASCII characters before adding to PDF
· Ensured all special characters like • and ✓ are now properly handled

This should eliminate the strange characters in the completed activities section of your exported PDF.
